{"Input.full_text": "Happy to aid in the fight against germany and france as well", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 0, "3a_apologies.yes": 0, "3a_compliment.yes": 1, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 0, "3a_reassurance.yes": 0, "4shareinformation.yes": 1}
{"Input.full_text": "I'm going to be hit or miss with connectivity this evening, so I'm putting moves in now.", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 1, "3a_apologies.yes": 0, "3a_compliment.yes": 1, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 0, "3a_reassurance.yes": 1, "4shareinformation.yes": 0}
{"Input.full_text": "And if so, how do you feel about it?", "1gamemove.yes": 0, "2reasoning.yes": 0, "3rapport.yes": 0, "3a_apologies.yes": 1, "3a_compliment.yes": 1, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 1, "3a_reassurance.yes": 0, "4shareinformation.yes": 0}
{"Input.full_text": "I'd like to hold it for at least one more season, but then will probably move out", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 1, "3a_apologies.yes": 1, "3a_compliment.yes": 1, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 1, "3a_reassurance.yes": 1, "4shareinformation.yes": 1}
{"Input.full_text": "I have so much to offer besides just bedside adventures", "1gamemove.yes": 0, "2reasoning.yes": 0, "3rapport.yes": 1, "3a_apologies.yes": 0, "3a_compliment.yes": 0, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 0, "3a_reassurance.yes": 0, "4shareinformation.yes": 1}
{"Input.full_text": "I really don't think an attack from Gascony would be an issue, but I understand that your trust in France is much lower than mine.", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 1, "3a_apologies.yes": 1, "3a_compliment.yes": 1, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 1, "3a_reassurance.yes": 0, "4shareinformation.yes": 0}
{"Input.full_text": "There is just less chance that something goes wrong, and less chance I end up blaming someone else if something goes wrong.", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 0, "3a_apologies.yes": 0, "3a_compliment.yes": 0, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 0, "3a_reassurance.yes": 0, "4shareinformation.yes": 1}
{"Input.full_text": "The more I look at the board the more likely it seems T & R are biding their time for R to rebuild and then ally up", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 1, "3a_apologies.yes": 0, "3a_compliment.yes": 1, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 1, "3a_reassurance.yes": 1, "4shareinformation.yes": 0}
{"Input.full_text": "Itll give me more options for next round (maybe take Bud back from Italy?", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 1, "3a_apologies.yes": 1, "3a_compliment.yes": 1, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 1, "3a_reassurance.yes": 1, "4shareinformation.yes": 1}
{"Input.full_text": "Hes getting hella builds next turn, and then hes going SOMEWHERE", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 1, "3a_apologies.yes": 0, "3a_compliment.yes": 1, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 1, "3a_reassurance.yes": 1, "4shareinformation.yes": 0}
{"Input.full_text": "Italy doesn't trust him either and I convinced him to invade the south although he's kind of a mess at the moment.", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 1, "3a_apologies.yes": 0, "3a_compliment.yes": 1, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 0, "3a_reassurance.yes": 1, "4shareinformation.yes": 1}
{"Input.full_text": "I think the builds we see this winter will make it more clear what's possible.", "1gamemove.yes": 0, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 1, "3a_apologies.yes": 0, "3a_compliment.yes": 0, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 1, "3a_reassurance.yes": 0, "4shareinformation.yes": 0}
{"Input.full_text": "I've moved out of the country now though.", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 0, "3a_apologies.yes": 0, "3a_compliment.yes": 0, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 0, "3a_reassurance.yes": 0, "4shareinformation.yes": 0}
{"Input.full_text": "If either of those are true then a 3 unit south start seems likely.", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 0, "3a_apologies.yes": 0, "3a_compliment.yes": 0, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 0, "3a_reassurance.yes": 0, "4shareinformation.yes": 0}
{"Input.full_text": "If they're not convoying, then perhaps, but I think an open Mao is still better than an Italian mao.", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 1, "3a_apologies.yes": 0, "3a_compliment.yes": 1, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 1, "3a_reassurance.yes": 1, "4shareinformation.yes": 0}
{"Input.full_text": "(Sending to all remaining powers that aren't Turkey)", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 1, "3a_apologies.yes": 1, "3a_compliment.yes": 1, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 1, "3a_reassurance.yes": 1, "4shareinformation.yes": 1}
{"Input.full_text": "No worries, it's the game, and I think you made the right choice.", "1gamemove.yes": 0, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 0, "3a_apologies.yes": 1, "3a_compliment.yes": 0, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 0, "3a_reassurance.yes": 0, "4shareinformation.yes": 0}
{"Input.full_text": "As awesome as that sounds, I have an Austrian problem to deal with first.", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 1, "3a_apologies.yes": 1, "3a_compliment.yes": 1, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 1, "3a_reassurance.yes": 1, "4shareinformation.yes": 1}
{"Input.full_text": "Ok, I spoke with turkey and they are on board.", "1gamemove.yes": 0, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 0, "3a_apologies.yes": 1, "3a_compliment.yes": 0, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 0, "3a_reassurance.yes": 0, "4shareinformation.yes": 0}
{"Input.full_text": "Not the end of the world- but I was hoping France and Turkey would be well on their way to dead by now.", "1gamemove.yes": 0, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 0, "3a_apologies.yes": 0, "3a_compliment.yes": 0, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 0, "3a_reassurance.yes": 0, "4shareinformation.yes": 0}
{"Input.full_text": "Speaking of England, one thing annoying about E/G alliances is that you really only have this one chance to build a fleet without signalling your change of intentions too obviously: now.", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 1, "3a_apologies.yes": 1, "3a_compliment.yes": 0, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 1, "3a_reassurance.yes": 1, "4shareinformation.yes": 0}
{"Input.full_text": "I don't have much info right now unfortunately.", "1gamemove.yes": 0, "2reasoning.yes": 0, "3rapport.yes": 0, "3a_apologies.yes": 0, "3a_compliment.yes": 0, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 0, "3a_reassurance.yes": 0, "4shareinformation.yes": 0}
{"Input.full_text": "I guess it shows commitment to an English-Italian alliance, but I'm a little surprised to see a stab like that this soon.", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 0, "3rapport.yes": 0, "3a_apologies.yes": 1, "3a_compliment.yes": 0, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 0, "3a_reassurance.yes": 0, "4shareinformation.yes": 0}
{"Input.full_text": "Especially if the three of us work things out, you could drop down to the Baltic Sea and we'd be able to split Germany very quickly", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 1, "3a_apologies.yes": 1, "3a_compliment.yes": 1, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 1, "3a_reassurance.yes": 1, "4shareinformation.yes": 1}
{"Input.full_text": "If we schedule a bounce in Smyrna in the Spring, could I count on your support into Bulgaria in the Fall?", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 1, "3a_apologies.yes": 0, "3a_compliment.yes": 0, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 1, "3a_reassurance.yes": 0, "4shareinformation.yes": 0}
{"Input.full_text": "I dont want that to be my role in this game, so I hope that you will consider my proposal.", "1gamemove.yes": 0, "2reasoning.yes": 0, "3rapport.yes": 0, "3a_apologies.yes": 1, "3a_compliment.yes": 1, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 0, "3a_reassurance.yes": 1, "4shareinformation.yes": 1}
{"Input.full_text": "And what devious thing could you do with Tyr that wouldn't immediately begin aggressions with austria?", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 1, "3a_apologies.yes": 1, "3a_compliment.yes": 1, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 1, "3a_reassurance.yes": 1, "4shareinformation.yes": 1}
{"Input.full_text": "They told me to tell you that they plan to attack Piedmont with support, which indicates that they're probably planning a convoy to Tuscany.", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 1, "3a_apologies.yes": 0, "3a_compliment.yes": 1, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 1, "3a_reassurance.yes": 1, "4shareinformation.yes": 1}
{"Input.full_text": "So even if the move to Nao doesn't pan out, you can just build an army in Edi and use that to take back lvp", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 0, "3rapport.yes": 1, "3a_apologies.yes": 0, "3a_compliment.yes": 1, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 0, "3a_reassurance.yes": 1, "4shareinformation.yes": 0}
{"Input.full_text": "I think France is being friendly with everyone", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 1, "3a_apologies.yes": 0, "3a_compliment.yes": 1, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 1, "3a_reassurance.yes": 0, "4shareinformation.yes": 0}
{"Input.full_text": "I hope E/G don't have another country in their pocket, who else told you about Italy going west?", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 1, "3a_apologies.yes": 0, "3a_compliment.yes": 1, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 1, "3a_reassurance.yes": 1, "4shareinformation.yes": 0}
{"Input.full_text": "Well shit bru,  I have tried everything I can think to change the board stacked against you to no avail", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 1, "3a_apologies.yes": 0, "3a_compliment.yes": 1, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 0, "3a_reassurance.yes": 0, "4shareinformation.yes": 1}
{"Input.full_text": "From here we're well positioned to start hitting Italy on their home turf, esp.", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 0, "3a_apologies.yes": 0, "3a_compliment.yes": 0, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 0, "3a_reassurance.yes": 0, "4shareinformation.yes": 0}
{"Input.full_text": "Priority number one is to get England and Germany turned against each other, or they will be too big for us to handle later.", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 0, "3a_apologies.yes": 1, "3a_compliment.yes": 0, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 1, "3a_reassurance.yes": 1, "4shareinformation.yes": 0}
{"Input.full_text": "This spring turn I would put a fleet in NAO and NTH while you move NTH into NRG and SWE into SKA.", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 0, "3rapport.yes": 1, "3a_apologies.yes": 0, "3a_compliment.yes": 1, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 0, "3a_reassurance.yes": 1, "4shareinformation.yes": 0}
{"Input.full_text": "I was trying to keep the press clear (and trying to pretend to myself I didn't know who you were either) in case it impacted the study.", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 1, "3a_apologies.yes": 1, "3a_compliment.yes": 1, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 1, "3a_reassurance.yes": 1, "4shareinformation.yes": 1}
{"Input.full_text": "It cripples him in the Balkans, and since I can break his support from StP we lock down all of Scandinavia next year.", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 1, "3a_apologies.yes": 1, "3a_compliment.yes": 1, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 1, "3a_reassurance.yes": 1, "4shareinformation.yes": 1}
{"Input.full_text": "But if you see it differently, let me know.", "1gamemove.yes": 0, "2reasoning.yes": 0, "3rapport.yes": 0, "3a_apologies.yes": 1, "3a_compliment.yes": 0, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 0, "3a_reassurance.yes": 0, "4shareinformation.yes": 0}
{"Input.full_text": "Either way, telling me that is not good news for me", "1gamemove.yes": 0, "2reasoning.yes": 0, "3rapport.yes": 0, "3a_apologies.yes": 1, "3a_compliment.yes": 0, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 0, "3a_reassurance.yes": 0, "4shareinformation.yes": 0}
{"Input.full_text": "Next turn I can support you into Nth again, and you will definitely get it, since I have the army in whales to cut support", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 0, "3rapport.yes": 1, "3a_apologies.yes": 1, "3a_compliment.yes": 0, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 1, "3a_reassurance.yes": 1, "4shareinformation.yes": 0}
{"Input.full_text": "This would be a break of my DMZ with France in the channel.", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 0, "3a_apologies.yes": 0, "3a_compliment.yes": 1, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 1, "3a_reassurance.yes": 1, "4shareinformation.yes": 0}
{"Input.full_text": "Would have been wise to check the map before sending messages", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 0, "3rapport.yes": 1, "3a_apologies.yes": 0, "3a_compliment.yes": 0, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 1, "3a_reassurance.yes": 0, "4shareinformation.yes": 0}
{"Input.full_text": "The reason for that is that I think Italy is far more duplicitous than any of us ever realized; right now they may be promising you that you'll take centers of mine, and maybe even that you two will share a victory together.", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 1, "3a_apologies.yes": 0, "3a_compliment.yes": 1, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 1, "3a_reassurance.yes": 1, "4shareinformation.yes": 0}
{"Input.full_text": "I'll open some back channels to see if I can learn anything, but there may not be much to do other than cheerleading any time we hear someone suggest a Sea Lion, or England asking you if you'll just divert Gob-Swe to instead do Bal while they convoy to Den, when Germany ends up in Swe instead of bouncing you out...", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 1, "3a_apologies.yes": 1, "3a_compliment.yes": 0, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 1, "3a_reassurance.yes": 1, "4shareinformation.yes": 0}
{"Input.full_text": "But whatever helps you eat your lasagna of deceit.", "1gamemove.yes": 0, "2reasoning.yes": 0, "3rapport.yes": 0, "3a_apologies.yes": 0, "3a_compliment.yes": 1, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 0, "3a_reassurance.yes": 0, "4shareinformation.yes": 0}
{"Input.full_text": "Oh - yeah, there's not enough time in this game to hit a solo.", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 0, "3a_apologies.yes": 0, "3a_compliment.yes": 1, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 0, "3a_reassurance.yes": 0, "4shareinformation.yes": 0}
{"Input.full_text": "What do you want to see me pull?", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 0, "3rapport.yes": 1, "3a_apologies.yes": 0, "3a_compliment.yes": 1, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 0, "3a_reassurance.yes": 1, "4shareinformation.yes": 0}
{"Input.full_text": "England and Italy and I feel the pressure already.", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 1, "3a_apologies.yes": 1, "3a_compliment.yes": 0, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 1, "3a_reassurance.yes": 0, "4shareinformation.yes": 0}
{"Input.full_text": "I imagine France would be open to a deal that had me moving away... again.", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 0, "3a_apologies.yes": 0, "3a_compliment.yes": 0, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 0, "3a_reassurance.yes": 0, "4shareinformation.yes": 1}
{"Input.full_text": "sorry, i'm on the west coast and still at work and still slammed", "1gamemove.yes": 0, "2reasoning.yes": 0, "3rapport.yes": 0, "3a_apologies.yes": 0, "3a_compliment.yes": 0, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 0, "3a_reassurance.yes": 0, "4shareinformation.yes": 0}
{"Input.full_text": "I'm down for the draw that he has proposed.", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 1, "3a_apologies.yes": 1, "3a_compliment.yes": 0, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 1, "3a_reassurance.yes": 0, "4shareinformation.yes": 0}
{"Input.full_text": "If you do intend to do so, please move back from my lands.", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 1, "3a_apologies.yes": 0, "3a_compliment.yes": 0, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 0, "3a_reassurance.yes": 1, "4shareinformation.yes": 0}
{"Input.full_text": "Yeah I didnt believe that turkey wanted to go against Russia but it looks like he actually does", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 1, "3a_apologies.yes": 1, "3a_compliment.yes": 1, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 1, "3a_reassurance.yes": 1, "4shareinformation.yes": 1}
{"Input.full_text": "Are you on board for a 3 way draw?", "1gamemove.yes": 0, "2reasoning.yes": 0, "3rapport.yes": 0, "3a_apologies.yes": 0, "3a_compliment.yes": 0, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 0, "3a_reassurance.yes": 1, "4shareinformation.yes": 1}
{"Input.full_text": "I have not yet heard anything from Italy unfortunately.", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 0, "3a_apologies.yes": 0, "3a_compliment.yes": 0, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 0, "3a_reassurance.yes": 1, "4shareinformation.yes": 1}
{"Input.full_text": "You realize that one has to dislodge a unit in order to stop it from convoying.", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 0, "3a_apologies.yes": 0, "3a_compliment.yes": 0, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 0, "3a_reassurance.yes": 0, "4shareinformation.yes": 0}
{"Input.full_text": "I have communicated with them a few times, but they don't really seem interested in talking.", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 0, "3a_apologies.yes": 1, "3a_compliment.yes": 1, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 0, "3a_reassurance.yes": 0, "4shareinformation.yes": 0}
{"Input.full_text": "Does post-war things mean how we're going to deal with a seriously overpowered Austria/Italy?", "1gamemove.yes": 0, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 1, "3a_apologies.yes": 0, "3a_compliment.yes": 0, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 0, "3a_reassurance.yes": 0, "4shareinformation.yes": 0}
{"Input.full_text": "Can you please confirm that you will be moving Armenia to sev supported by Black Sea?", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 0, "3rapport.yes": 0, "3a_apologies.yes": 0, "3a_compliment.yes": 1, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 1, "3a_reassurance.yes": 1, "4shareinformation.yes": 1}
{"Input.full_text": "I'm on board with the five-way draw, by the way.", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 1, "3a_apologies.yes": 0, "3a_compliment.yes": 1, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 0, "3a_reassurance.yes": 1, "4shareinformation.yes": 1}
{"Input.full_text": "Austria and I commiserate around how much a dirty rat you are, you tell them that you were sure they were lying, and \"sorry I didn't trust you, but I'll keep attacking Turkey, watch, they think I'll park my fleet in Rum, but I'll attack them instead!\".", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 1, "3a_apologies.yes": 1, "3a_compliment.yes": 1, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 1, "3a_reassurance.yes": 1, "4shareinformation.yes": 1}
{"Input.full_text": "I am certainly interested in your ideas on this.", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 1, "3a_apologies.yes": 1, "3a_compliment.yes": 1, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 1, "3a_reassurance.yes": 1, "4shareinformation.yes": 1}
{"Input.full_text": "Just know that I need a real response before the deadline is over if you are serious about actually working things out.", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 0, "3rapport.yes": 0, "3a_apologies.yes": 0, "3a_compliment.yes": 1, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 0, "3a_reassurance.yes": 0, "4shareinformation.yes": 0}
{"Input.full_text": "It looks like France is committed then, and I find it unlikely hed leave himself wide open to England and Germany if he didnt expect them to take his side.", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 1, "3a_apologies.yes": 1, "3a_compliment.yes": 1, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 1, "3a_reassurance.yes": 1, "4shareinformation.yes": 1}
{"Input.full_text": "I've enjoyed speaking with you, by the way.", "1gamemove.yes": 0, "2reasoning.yes": 0, "3rapport.yes": 0, "3a_apologies.yes": 0, "3a_compliment.yes": 0, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 0, "3a_reassurance.yes": 0, "4shareinformation.yes": 1}
{"Input.full_text": "I left Galicia and that should give us some space to work together, if youd like to make a suggestion.", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 1, "3a_apologies.yes": 1, "3a_compliment.yes": 0, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 0, "3a_reassurance.yes": 0, "4shareinformation.yes": 0}
{"Input.full_text": "It's a large Diplomacy server with a great community and good gameplay.", "1gamemove.yes": 0, "2reasoning.yes": 0, "3rapport.yes": 0, "3a_apologies.yes": 0, "3a_compliment.yes": 0, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 0, "3a_reassurance.yes": 0, "4shareinformation.yes": 0}
{"Input.full_text": "You seem like a nice guy dril :)", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 0, "3rapport.yes": 0, "3a_apologies.yes": 0, "3a_compliment.yes": 0, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 0, "3a_reassurance.yes": 0, "4shareinformation.yes": 0}
{"Input.full_text": "Yeah, I just figured that you might keep your last unit alive as a janissary if I kept Portugal blue.", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 1, "3a_apologies.yes": 0, "3a_compliment.yes": 1, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 1, "3a_reassurance.yes": 1, "4shareinformation.yes": 0}
{"Input.full_text": "I will move towards Ank on land (unless you want to set up a convoy in the Black Sea) and we can settle with the 3-way draw then", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 1, "3a_apologies.yes": 1, "3a_compliment.yes": 0, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 1, "3a_reassurance.yes": 1, "4shareinformation.yes": 0}
{"Input.full_text": "The question is what we expect EG to do while we're moving on T. I don't have an answer to that right now, but swapping straight back to Triple has to be a temptation.", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 1, "3a_apologies.yes": 0, "3a_compliment.yes": 1, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 1, "3a_reassurance.yes": 1, "4shareinformation.yes": 0}
{"Input.full_text": "It places units in places that they can cut supports on Warsaw which dramatically increases our odds of taking it back if we loose it or maintaining it if we don't.", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 1, "3a_apologies.yes": 0, "3a_compliment.yes": 1, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 1, "3a_reassurance.yes": 1, "4shareinformation.yes": 0}
{"Input.full_text": "Im worried about England turning on me before France is sufficiently weakened, I think the two of them are still on decent terms (hard to tell with only these one on one conversations)", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 1, "3a_apologies.yes": 1, "3a_compliment.yes": 1, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 1, "3a_reassurance.yes": 1, "4shareinformation.yes": 1}
{"Input.full_text": "I mean im aware at this point that the two of you could choose to mow over me.", "1gamemove.yes": 0, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 0, "3a_apologies.yes": 0, "3a_compliment.yes": 1, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 0, "3a_reassurance.yes": 0, "4shareinformation.yes": 1}
{"Input.full_text": "Are you and Germany are still on good terms?", "1gamemove.yes": 0, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 0, "3a_apologies.yes": 1, "3a_compliment.yes": 0, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 1, "3a_reassurance.yes": 1, "4shareinformation.yes": 1}
{"Input.full_text": "Because it will be a grind between us while Austria gains momentum", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 1, "3a_apologies.yes": 0, "3a_compliment.yes": 1, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 1, "3a_reassurance.yes": 1, "4shareinformation.yes": 0}
{"Input.full_text": "I dont think I need to worry about Pru.", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 1, "3a_apologies.yes": 0, "3a_compliment.yes": 1, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 1, "3a_reassurance.yes": 0, "4shareinformation.yes": 0}
{"Input.full_text": "Whatever you want I literally have nothing to do with these units", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 0, "3a_apologies.yes": 0, "3a_compliment.yes": 1, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 1, "3a_reassurance.yes": 0, "4shareinformation.yes": 0}
{"Input.full_text": "Although technically, you're the one getting Rum", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 0, "3rapport.yes": 1, "3a_apologies.yes": 0, "3a_compliment.yes": 0, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 1, "3a_reassurance.yes": 0, "4shareinformation.yes": 0}
{"Input.full_text": "Ill try to finagle Germany on your behalf", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 1, "3a_apologies.yes": 1, "3a_compliment.yes": 1, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 1, "3a_reassurance.yes": 0, "4shareinformation.yes": 0}
{"Input.full_text": "Now, you could just go copy-paste this message to France and I'd be royally screwed, so I hope that helps you believe you can trust me.", "1gamemove.yes": 0, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 1, "3a_apologies.yes": 1, "3a_compliment.yes": 0, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 1, "3a_reassurance.yes": 0, "4shareinformation.yes": 1}
{"Input.full_text": "I actually felt like you didn't want to work with me, because you were saying you wouldn't work with me unless France backed off - something I cant control.", "1gamemove.yes": 0, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 0, "3a_apologies.yes": 0, "3a_compliment.yes": 0, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 0, "3a_reassurance.yes": 0, "4shareinformation.yes": 0}
{"Input.full_text": "Also i think when you have a fake plan, you should type the message up to me like youre asking for real.", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 1, "3a_apologies.yes": 1, "3a_compliment.yes": 1, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 1, "3a_reassurance.yes": 1, "4shareinformation.yes": 1}
{"Input.full_text": "Yeah, maybe they predicted that you'd think they were lying to me?", "1gamemove.yes": 0, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 1, "3a_apologies.yes": 0, "3a_compliment.yes": 0, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 0, "3a_reassurance.yes": 0, "4shareinformation.yes": 0}
{"Input.full_text": "I really need a build right now, and even though Russia is getting two builds, he seems reluctant to hand off Munich to me as previously discussed.", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 1, "3a_apologies.yes": 0, "3a_compliment.yes": 1, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 1, "3a_reassurance.yes": 1, "4shareinformation.yes": 0}
{"Input.full_text": "Are you aware of Italy manufacturing the agreement for England leaving Russia alone in Sweden and St. Petersburg?", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 1, "3a_apologies.yes": 0, "3a_compliment.yes": 1, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 0, "3a_reassurance.yes": 1, "4shareinformation.yes": 0}
{"Input.full_text": "And at some point we should talk about a fair split of the French supply centers just so there's no surprises.", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 1, "3a_apologies.yes": 1, "3a_compliment.yes": 1, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 1, "3a_reassurance.yes": 1, "4shareinformation.yes": 1}
{"Input.full_text": "If we're taking down Germany, it would make sense for you to support England to Denmark", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 1, "3a_apologies.yes": 1, "3a_compliment.yes": 0, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 0, "3a_reassurance.yes": 0, "4shareinformation.yes": 0}
{"Input.full_text": "Let them keep War/Mos warm for us for a while, and keep those juicy dots out of English hands.", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 1, "3a_apologies.yes": 1, "3a_compliment.yes": 1, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 1, "3a_reassurance.yes": 1, "4shareinformation.yes": 1}
{"Input.full_text": "How many fleets do you think I should bring East?", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 0, "3rapport.yes": 1, "3a_apologies.yes": 0, "3a_compliment.yes": 0, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 0, "3a_reassurance.yes": 0, "4shareinformation.yes": 0}
{"Input.full_text": "If that fleet gets disbanded bc of me he judtcrebuilds it next to Venice", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 1, "3a_apologies.yes": 0, "3a_compliment.yes": 1, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 1, "3a_reassurance.yes": 1, "4shareinformation.yes": 1}
{"Input.full_text": "Also, had you asked for a hold in Pie?", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 0, "3rapport.yes": 0, "3a_apologies.yes": 0, "3a_compliment.yes": 0, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 0, "3a_reassurance.yes": 0, "4shareinformation.yes": 0}
{"Input.full_text": "However your reason for being happy isnt as convincing as ours", "1gamemove.yes": 0, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 0, "3a_apologies.yes": 1, "3a_compliment.yes": 0, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 0, "3a_reassurance.yes": 0, "4shareinformation.yes": 1}
{"Input.full_text": "Yeah I didnt believe that turkey wanted to go against Russia but it looks like he actually does", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 1, "3a_apologies.yes": 1, "3a_compliment.yes": 1, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 1, "3a_reassurance.yes": 1, "4shareinformation.yes": 1}
{"Input.full_text": "I just realized we only have two more seasons.", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 1, "3a_apologies.yes": 1, "3a_compliment.yes": 1, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 1, "3a_reassurance.yes": 1, "4shareinformation.yes": 1}
{"Input.full_text": "Turkey thought we had an alliance but the last time we talked he said he was attacking Me until we figured it out.", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 1, "3a_apologies.yes": 0, "3a_compliment.yes": 1, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 1, "3a_reassurance.yes": 1, "4shareinformation.yes": 1}
{"Input.full_text": "Would you mind offering France some advice under the guise of trying to keep the west together longer?", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 1, "3a_apologies.yes": 0, "3a_compliment.yes": 1, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 1, "3a_reassurance.yes": 1, "4shareinformation.yes": 0}
{"Input.full_text": "It would be my preference that you hold Mao, on the assumption that if it came down to a choice between partnering with me or England, you'd choose me.", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 1, "3a_apologies.yes": 1, "3a_compliment.yes": 1, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 1, "3a_reassurance.yes": 0, "4shareinformation.yes": 0}
{"Input.full_text": "You can win by putting in more time and effort than everyone else.", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 1, "3a_apologies.yes": 0, "3a_compliment.yes": 1, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 1, "3a_reassurance.yes": 1, "4shareinformation.yes": 0}
{"Input.full_text": "One thing I'm curious about: Why would you want Germany and I to be friends?", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 0, "3rapport.yes": 0, "3a_apologies.yes": 0, "3a_compliment.yes": 0, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 0, "3a_reassurance.yes": 0, "4shareinformation.yes": 0}
{"Input.full_text": "Well, if things go accordingly then Italy should be losing two builds this season.", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 1, "3a_apologies.yes": 1, "3a_compliment.yes": 1, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 1, "3a_reassurance.yes": 1, "4shareinformation.yes": 1}
{"Input.full_text": "Austria asked if I am willing to DMZ Gal", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 0, "3rapport.yes": 0, "3a_apologies.yes": 0, "3a_compliment.yes": 1, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 0, "3a_reassurance.yes": 0, "4shareinformation.yes": 1}
{"Input.full_text": "I'm on good terms with him (to protect my backdoor) with a short NAP, but if he gets a quick jump it could be trouble.", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 1, "3a_apologies.yes": 1, "3a_compliment.yes": 1, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 1, "3a_reassurance.yes": 1, "4shareinformation.yes": 1}
{"Input.full_text": "What are your thoughts on supporting Bre to Gas from Par?", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 1, "3a_apologies.yes": 1, "3a_compliment.yes": 1, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 1, "3a_reassurance.yes": 1, "4shareinformation.yes": 1}
{"Input.full_text": "We dont need to actually *do* that - I just told him that.", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 1, "3a_apologies.yes": 0, "3a_compliment.yes": 1, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 0, "3a_reassurance.yes": 0, "4shareinformation.yes": 0}
{"Input.full_text": "Youre not going to stab me for one dot, I certainly hope.", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 1, "3a_apologies.yes": 0, "3a_compliment.yes": 1, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 1, "3a_reassurance.yes": 1, "4shareinformation.yes": 0}
{"Input.full_text": "If so we won't be able to convoy from stp and will have to settle for doing it from nwy.", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 0, "3rapport.yes": 1, "3a_apologies.yes": 0, "3a_compliment.yes": 1, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 0, "3a_reassurance.yes": 1, "4shareinformation.yes": 0}
{"Input.full_text": "Yep, taking Hol means Ruh falls which opens up the delicious wines of Burgundy!", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 1, "3a_apologies.yes": 0, "3a_compliment.yes": 1, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 1, "3a_reassurance.yes": 1, "4shareinformation.yes": 0}
{"Input.full_text": "I think most likely this will be doable in Rum.", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 0, "3rapport.yes": 1, "3a_apologies.yes": 0, "3a_compliment.yes": 1, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 1, "3a_reassurance.yes": 1, "4shareinformation.yes": 0}
{"Input.full_text": "I think Im going to shoot for Bre, just in case its open.", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 0, "3rapport.yes": 1, "3a_apologies.yes": 0, "3a_compliment.yes": 0, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 0, "3a_reassurance.yes": 0, "4shareinformation.yes": 0}
{"Input.full_text": "Specificallly, you may be able to take warsaw", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 0, "3a_apologies.yes": 0, "3a_compliment.yes": 0, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 1, "3a_reassurance.yes": 0, "4shareinformation.yes": 1}
{"Input.full_text": "I have enough to go all the way to ion with Queen Esther starting it off in nth sea", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 1, "3a_apologies.yes": 1, "3a_compliment.yes": 1, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 1, "3a_reassurance.yes": 1, "4shareinformation.yes": 1}
{"Input.full_text": "I'm aware I might have pissed you off a little, and I'd like to change the course of that.", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 1, "3a_apologies.yes": 1, "3a_compliment.yes": 1, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 1, "3a_reassurance.yes": 1, "4shareinformation.yes": 1}
{"Input.full_text": "Tbf I can't even really talk, the British are being extremely uncooperative because of my previous action against them.", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 1, "3a_apologies.yes": 0, "3a_compliment.yes": 1, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 1, "3a_reassurance.yes": 1, "4shareinformation.yes": 0}
{"Input.full_text": "I wish you the best of luck and i'm sorry if things turn out super bad for you.", "1gamemove.yes": 0, "2reasoning.yes": 0, "3rapport.yes": 0, "3a_apologies.yes": 1, "3a_compliment.yes": 0, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 0, "3a_reassurance.yes": 0, "4shareinformation.yes": 0}
{"Input.full_text": "I should have realized that with Lon moving to Eng that move would not have gone through anyway, but I'm not paying as much attention to this game anymore.", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 0, "3rapport.yes": 0, "3a_apologies.yes": 0, "3a_compliment.yes": 0, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 0, "3a_reassurance.yes": 0, "4shareinformation.yes": 0}
{"Input.full_text": "If you think it might work, I'd totally support you to Holland, or I can tap Holland to make sure it can't leave by going to Helgoland without losing it.", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 1, "3a_apologies.yes": 1, "3a_compliment.yes": 1, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 1, "3a_reassurance.yes": 1, "4shareinformation.yes": 1}
{"Input.full_text": "It'd definitely throw a wrench in what the Italian expects.", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 1, "3a_apologies.yes": 0, "3a_compliment.yes": 1, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 1, "3a_reassurance.yes": 1, "4shareinformation.yes": 1}
{"Input.full_text": "I imagine France would be open to a deal that had me moving away... again.", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 1, "3a_apologies.yes": 1, "3a_compliment.yes": 1, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 1, "3a_reassurance.yes": 1, "4shareinformation.yes": 1}
{"Input.full_text": "I'd be interested to know if you've heard anything from France or Italy?", "1gamemove.yes": 0, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 0, "3a_apologies.yes": 1, "3a_compliment.yes": 0, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 0, "3a_reassurance.yes": 0, "4shareinformation.yes": 0}
{"Input.full_text": "I don't object to someone defending themselves, but you could have said something  I haven't lied to you yet and don't intend on starting now.", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 1, "3a_apologies.yes": 1, "3a_compliment.yes": 1, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 0, "3a_reassurance.yes": 0, "4shareinformation.yes": 0}
{"Input.full_text": "Ok, let's see how things play out and I'll be in touch if I need help", "1gamemove.yes": 0, "2reasoning.yes": 0, "3rapport.yes": 0, "3a_apologies.yes": 0, "3a_compliment.yes": 0, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 0, "3a_reassurance.yes": 0, "4shareinformation.yes": 1}
{"Input.full_text": "I know you must be anxious if Germany and Russia are not talking to you much, but I have to stress that this is not because I am working with them, and I am not moving to the channel.", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 1, "3a_apologies.yes": 1, "3a_compliment.yes": 1, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 1, "3a_reassurance.yes": 1, "4shareinformation.yes": 1}
{"Input.full_text": "If you agree to a ceasefire I promise to pull armies out of your lands", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 1, "3rapport.yes": 0, "3a_apologies.yes": 0, "3a_compliment.yes": 1, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 0, "3a_reassurance.yes": 0, "4shareinformation.yes": 1}
{"Input.full_text": "I have another proposal if youre interested", "1gamemove.yes": 1, "2reasoning.yes": 0, "3rapport.yes": 0, "3a_apologies.yes": 1, "3a_compliment.yes": 1, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 1, "3a_reassurance.yes": 0, "4shareinformation.yes": 0}
{"Input.full_text": "What is the out of game thing?", "1gamemove.yes": 0, "2reasoning.yes": 0, "3rapport.yes": 0, "3a_apologies.yes": 0, "3a_compliment.yes": 0, "3a_personalthoughts.yes": 0, "3a_reassurance.yes": 0, "4shareinformation.yes": 0}
